      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "<h2>Failure Drill</h2><p>Use this view while running <code>scripts/link-down-campus-pe.sh</code> and <code>scripts/link-up-campus-pe.sh</code>. Watch how the counters behave before, during, and after the failure, then compare that with OpenNMS events and outages.</p><p>Questions to answer: what changed first, what disappeared entirely, and what became an outage versus just a metric change?</p>",
        "mode": "html"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.2.0",
      "title": "How To Use This Dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "grafana"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
